gia/ware-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Ware County has a rainfall record of 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value got 18% of normal in September to October and 25% in October to November. Grid 13091 had its driest year in 1954, at 54% of normal.</p>"}
